course: dictionary
lesson: 11916
title: Businessman: a person in trade
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A businessman is a man who works in business. He may run a company, buy and sell goods, or work in an office. «The businessman opened a shop in our town.» The clue is opened a shop, which tells you he works in trade.
explain: Business means work that earns money, such as making, buying or selling things. Look for clue words like company, shop, deal or office. «My uncle is a successful businessman who runs three cafés.» Successful tells you he does well with money.
explain: The word has two parts: business and man. Business is the work, and man is a grown male person. The plural is businessmen. «The businessmen met to talk about a new deal.»
fact: A businessman is a man who works in business.
fact: A businessman can run a company, buy and sell goods, or work in an office.
fact: The plural of businessman is businessmen.
fact: A businessman can also be someone who is good at making deals and money.
fact: Phrases to know: «a successful businessman» and «a local businessman».
exercise: «The businessman opened a shop in our town.» What kind of work does he do? | Teaching at a school | Farming in the fields | *Business and trade | Acting on a stage
exercise: What is the plural of businessman? | Businessman's | Businessmans | *Businessmen | Businessmens
exercise: «My uncle is a successful businessman who is good at making deals.» What does successful suggest? | *He does well and makes money | He is very tired | He sleeps all day | He is lost and confused
test: «The local businessman gave the school a new computer.» What does local mean here? | Sent by post | *From or near our town | Hidden under the stairs | Very large and famous
test: Which word best describes a businessman who buys and sells goods for money? | Painter | Gardener | Sailor | *Trader
exam: Which of these describes a businessman? | Someone who paints pictures for a living | Someone who only plays football | *Someone who runs a company or works in trade | Someone who sings in the street
